5. POST /policies/{policy_version}/activate 是做什麼的
這支 API 的用途是：

把剛剛上傳完成的 draft policy version，正式切成 active version

這樣做有兩個好處：

避免 policy 傳一半就生效
可以保留 version 與 audit trail
6. POST /policies/{policy_version}/activate req / resp 範例

Request

POST /v2/internal/spaces/engineering/policies/17/activate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <space-be-service-token>
{
  "space_id": "engineering",
  "policy_version": 17,
  "expected_checksum": "sha256:3d1dd7d3f99a7f4b4a6d...",
  "expected_rule_set_count": 3,
  "activated_by": {
    "actor_type": "user",
    "actor_id": "u_owner_001"
  },
  "reason": "publish permissions from space management UI"
}
Response

{
  "space_id": "engineering",
  "active_policy_version": 17,
  "previous_policy_version": 16,
  "status": "active",
  "activated_at": "2026-03-30T14:10:32Z",
